4. Simple Table
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Student Marks</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Student Marks</h1>

    <table border="1">
        <tr>
            <th>Name</th>
            <th>Subject</th>
            <th>Marks</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Raj</td>
            <td>Java</td>
            <td>85</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Raj</td>
            <td>HTML</td>
            <td>90</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</body>
</html>

Output:
| Name | Subject | Marks |
| ---- | ------- | ----: |
| Raj  | Java    |    85 |
| Raj  | HTML    |    90 |

